  ⚠ vue(valid-v-on): 'v-on' directives don't support the modifier 'bogus'.
   ╭─[valid_v_on.tsx:1:19]
 1 │ <template><button @click.bogus="onClick" /></template>
   ·                   ────────────
   ╰────
  help: Remove the modifier, or add it to the rule's `modifiers` option if it is a custom modifier your event handler recognizes.

  ⚠ vue(valid-v-on): 'v-on' directives require a value or verb modifier (like 'stop' or 'prevent').
   ╭─[valid_v_on.tsx:1:19]
 1 │ <template><button v-on:click /></template>
   ·                   ──────────
   ╰────
  help: Give the listener a handler, e.g. `@click="onClick"`, or add `.stop`/`.prevent`.

  ⚠ vue(valid-v-on): 'v-on' directives require a value or verb modifier (like 'stop' or 'prevent').
   ╭─[valid_v_on.tsx:1:19]
 1 │ <template><button @click /></template>
   ·                   ──────
   ╰────
  help: Give the listener a handler, e.g. `@click="onClick"`, or add `.stop`/`.prevent`.

  ⚠ vue(valid-v-on): 'v-on' directives require a value or verb modifier (like 'stop' or 'prevent').
   ╭─[valid_v_on.tsx:1:19]
 1 │ <template><button @click="" /></template>
   ·                   ─────────
   ╰────
  help: Give the listener a handler, e.g. `@click="onClick"`, or add `.stop`/`.prevent`.

  ⚠ vue(valid-v-on): Avoid using JavaScript keyword as "v-on" value: delete.
